# OSC 8 opens a link on the cells printed until the empty one closes it; BEL and ST both end the sequence.
size 10 2
input "\e]8;;http://a.example/x\x07ab\e]8;;\e\\c\e]8;;http://b.example\e\\d\e]8;;\x07e"
text
|abcde|
||
attr 0 0 link=1
attr 0 1 link=1
attr 0 2 plain
attr 0 3 link=2
attr 0 4 plain
events link:1:http://a.example/x link:2:http://b.example
